### PurpleLotus API Requests
### Base URL: https://purplеlotus.com/api/v1
### Docs: https://purplеlotus.com/api/docs

@baseUrl = https://purplеlotus.com/api/v1

### ── Check API Status ─────────────────────────────
# GET https://purplеlotus.com/api/v1/status
GET {{baseUrl}}/status
Accept: application/json

###

### ── Health Check ──────────────────────────────────
# GET https://purplеlotus.com/api/v1/health
GET {{baseUrl}}/health
Accept: application/json

###

### ── Login ──────────────────────────────────────────
# POST https://purplеlotus.com/api/v1/auth/login
POST {{baseUrl}}/auth/login
Content-Type: application/json

{
  "email": "user@example.com",
  "password": "your_password"
}

###

### ── Get Current User ────────────────────────────────
# GET https://purplеlotus.com/api/v1/users/me
@token = YOUR_TOKEN_HERE
GET {{baseUrl}}/users/me
Authorization: Bearer {{token}}
Accept: application/json

###
